{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9a3791f5-169c-8525-aae9-54c39afc2b1d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T13:15:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Min-jun Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I hit a pothole this morning and it blew my tire. The rim is bent too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, I'm sorry. Where did that happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "437 Memorial Boulevard. Right out front of the building, by the curb lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 437 Memorial. Can you describe the hole for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's big. Deep. It's full of water right now so you can't see where it ends. I didn't see it until I was in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, with the rain coming down today those get hidden fast. Was anybody hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:12:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Just the car. Tire is gone, and the rim won't hold air."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'm putting this in as a road hazard so a crew can look at it. Do you have a phone number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four oh one, five five five, zero one seven five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one seven five. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Min-jun Singh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Singh. Spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "S-I-N-G-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does it usually take to fix one of these? Somebody is going to hit it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the weather, honestly. Crews can't patch in a storm because the material won't hold. Once it clears out, a lot of the time it's a few days to a week, and sometimes they cone it off sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. That's a long time for a hole that size."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:13:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll mark it as a hazard with the water in it, so it gets looked at early. Is it in the travel lane or toward the edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Toward the edge, but still in the lane. Cars can't miss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've got that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry if I sound short. I work in a school kitchen. I serve lunch. This is my only quiet minute all day, and I'm standing in the walk-in hallway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize, I'm glad you called on your break. Let me tell you one more thing. For damage to your car, the city has a claim form. I can have that sent over, or you can pick one up at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Send it. I don't have time to go down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want it by mail or email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail. Same address. 437 Memorial Boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mailing it to 437 Memorial. It should show up in a few days. Keep your repair receipts and take a photo of the tire and rim if you haven't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have photos. I took them before the tow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:15:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Hang on to those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I have to go. Bell's about to ring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, Mr. Singh. We'll get that hole on the list. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:15:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
